# Licence status

This repository contains almost no code its author wrote. Read this before you copy,
mirror, redistribute or sell anything from it.

## 1. No licence is granted

Nothing in this repository grants you a licence — not to the Chessr.io application code,
not to the bundled engines, not to the images and fonts that ship with them.

- **Chessr.io application code** (`background.js`, `content-scripts/`, `chunks/`,
  `assets/`, `manifest.json`, `rules.json`) is proprietary. It is included for study and
  modification only. Its authors grant no redistribution right here, and this repository
  is in no position to grant one.
- **Bundled chess engines** are third-party and remain under their own terms, several of
  which are unresolved: Stockfish is GPL-3.0 and ships here without the licence text or a
  source offer; Komodo Dragon is commercial; others are unverified. The full inventory is
  in [`NOTICE.md`](NOTICE.md).

In plain terms: **the repository is a study archive, not a distributable product.** Treat
"all rights reserved" as the default for everything in it.

## 2. Repository-authored material

The documentation (`README.md`, `docs/`, `knowledge-base/`, `NOTICE.md`, this file), the
scripts in [`scripts/`](scripts) and the CI workflows are written for this project. They
are provided **as is, with no warranty of any kind**, and no permission is granted to
reuse them commercially. Ask the maintainer if you need something more specific.

## 3. Warranty

There is no warranty, express or implied, including merchantability or fitness for a
particular purpose. Nothing here is legal advice either — the licence statuses in
[`NOTICE.md`](NOTICE.md) are observations, not conclusions.

## 4. Using it is your risk

Installing the extension can get your accounts banned and breaks the terms of service of
every platform it runs on. See the [README's Disclaimer](README.md#disclaimer).
